_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 2
---
order: 2
---
short_label: V.2
---
statement: If a first magnitude is the same multiple of a second that a third is of a fourth, and a fifth also is the same multiple of the second that a sixth is of the fourth, then the sum of the first and fifth also is the same multiple of the second that the sum of the third and sixth is of the fourth.
---
proof:

---
body:

